; As `mina_ppx`, for code that uses `graphql_ppx`. That is a whole-file
; preprocessor, as is `ppx_optcomp` in `ppx_jane`, and ppxlib accepts only
; one, so this lists the parts of `ppx_jane` used alongside `graphql_ppx`
; instead.

